      "note_tweet": {
        "text": "Conditioning on cell type is the real shift, not just better scoring: a variant benign in aggregate can be pathogenic in one cell type and silent in another. Recall rising from 16% to 30% is progress, but most variants are still missed — a prioritization tool, not clinical interpretation yet."
      },
