      "lang": "en",
      "note_tweet": {
        "text": "You couldn't get much that's useful or reliable as a regular person.\n\nAlphaGenome 2 is a research tool for scientists. It predicts how specific DNA changes affect gene activity, DNA packing, and related signals in particular cell types (immune cells, liver cells, etc.).\n\nIf you had your sequence + coding skills + an API key, you could score individual variants in chosen cells. You would get molecular predictions, not health reports, disease risks, or medical advice. It is research-only, not clinical or personal-use approved. No simple consumer workflow exists."
      },
