        "note_tweet": {
          "text": "Your heart, brain, and immune system share the same DNA sequence. So how can a single-letter change affect disease in some cells, while sparing the rest?\n\nAlphaGenome 2 is our new AI model that zooms in on specific cells to help scientists understand what drives disease. 🧵"
